      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VELVET LEGEND (4) three runs back posted a handy 22.85 win over 400m at Gawler then has found the minor money in two runs since. Rates a top chance if runs up to time three back. ROYALE MAPLE (1) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish second (16.99) at this track in a Grade 6 over 300m. Has good early burn and is suited drawn on the inside. Well-placed to take this out. HOW IT'S DONE (6) is an honest type in the frame at six of 12 starts including three wins, the latest scoring (22.86) over 400m at Gawler. Has never been out of the money in five starts this distance. Expected to feature on best form. INVICTUS TOMMY (2) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
